Package: apache-cf-realip
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         apache2 (>= 2.4.0)
Description: Apache module for automatic Cloudflare IP fetching
 Automatically fetches Cloudflare IPv4/IPv6 CIDR ranges and generates
 RemoteIPTrustedProxy configuration for mod_remoteip. Enables real
 client IP restoration when Apache is behind Cloudflare. Port of
 nginx-cf-realip for Apache httpd. Written in Rust for memory safety.
